  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A stencil airbrush painting of a symmetrical totem figure with a feathered headdress, entirely in teal, navy and sky blue on white paper.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on white paper. The same frontal totem figure as the other Totem pieces, feather crown, ear ornaments, headdress band, narrow eyed face, side discs, arms and base, rendered only in blues: teal and navy gradients in the cells with sky blue and aqua highlight patches. Thin white gaps separate the cells.",
    "impression": "The totem under water, or carved from jade in moonlight. Keeping to one hue makes the stencil read as stone and shadow rather than decoration. The calmest of the four.",
